_:neb497a3c135447b499699cacff5876e0b18 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#rest> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#nil> .
<http://purl.org/vocab/frbr/core#supplement> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "\nAn expression work/expression having another one as supplement.\n        "@en .
_:neb497a3c135447b499699cacff5876e0b17 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#rest> _:neb497a3c135447b499699cacff5876e0b18 .
<http://purl.org/vocab/frbr/core#supplement> <http://www.linkedmodel.org/schema/vaem#rationale> "\nThis is used in combination with [OWL2 punning](https://www.w3.org/TR/owl2-new-features/#F12:_Punning) to characterise the type of a relation (\"IsSupplementedBy\") as an instance of `datacite:QualifiedRelation` via the property `datacite:hasRelationCharacterization`.\n        "@en .
_:neb497a3c135447b499699cacff5876e0b21 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#rest> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#nil> .
